        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Sopranos: Road to Respect is a 2006 video game based on the HBO series The Sopranos, which aired from January 10, 1999 to June 10, 2007. It was released on November 7, 2006.\nThe game's storyline takes place between the fifth and sixth seasons and centers on Big Pussy Bonpensiero's illegitimate son, Joey LaRocca, as he makes his way through the family business.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Sopranos: Road to Respect es un videojuego de 2006 basado en la serie de HBO The Sopranos, que se emitió desde el 10 de enero de 1999 hasta el 10 de junio de 2007. Se lanzó el 7 de noviembre de 2006.\nLa trama del juego transcurre entre la quinta y la sexta temporada y se centra en Joey LaRocca, el hijo ilegítimo de Big Pussy Bonpensiero, mientras se abre camino en el negocio familiar.",
